	(text "This is a \nbuck converter. It\nsteps down voltage. By \nswitching the voltage on \nand off over and over \nagain, the average\nvoltage outputted decreases."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0507d78c-f6ba-4522-8e1b-670a10bfb4b3")
	)
	(text ""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 77.216 83.566 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1c7d448a-7ff2-4148-ac7a-22c75c6f5f72")
	)
	(text "The capacitor essentially\ntakes in all the voltage\nwhen the power is on\nand when the switch is \noff it slowly discharges it,\npreventing the sudden up down\nof PWM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 145.796 125.222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1f8b4371-2a9c-4c8b-8e23-f33f38f9736b")
	)
	(text "This series of\ncapacitors, inductors\nand diodes is to\nmake the square wave\nvoltage created by \nthe buck converter into \nsomething more continuous\nfor the circuits to use"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.222 146.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "34667bdb-424e-4c60-bb6c-88a728258081")
	)
	(text "This is the power\nmanagement schematic\nwhich takes 24V\nfrom the LiPo Battery\nand steps it down\nto 3V3 voltage for the \nSTM32"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 68.58 82.804 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "86f77f2a-6ddd-49f4-9b4c-1544f5d32fd4")
	)
	(text "The inductor basically\nis a capacitor but it\nstores electric energy\nin a magnetic field. \nInductance is the tendency\nto resist current changes.\nSteady current means the\ninductor is just a wire,\nwhen the current changes the\ninductor pushes back.\nThis is basically used to smooth\nout the CURRENT coming out\nof the buck converter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.828 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "db992a9a-fe39-45a9-bfc4-d00917ce4dd3")
	)
